+# Domain Documentation Layout
+
+## Layout
+
+- **Single-context**: one `CONTEXT.md` at the repo root.
+- **ADRs**: `docs/adr/` directory.
+- **No `CONTEXT-MAP.md`** — there is only one context.
+
+## Consumer Rules
+
+### CONTEXT.md
+
+- Contains the project's domain language (Ubiquitous Language) — see the glossary in its "核心概念" section.
+- Skills (`improve-codebase-architecture`, `diagnosing-bugs`, `tdd`) read this to learn domain terms.
+- Always match test names and interface vocabulary to the terms defined here.
+
+### docs/adr/
+
+- Architectural Decision Records for hard-to-reverse decisions.
+- Read before making architecture changes that touch a decision's area.
+- Follow the same naming convention: `NNNN-title-with-dashes.md`.
+
+## Location
+
+```
+CONTEXT.md          ← domain glossary + business rules
+docs/
+  adr/              ← ADRs
+    NNNN-*.md
+  agents/           ← agent configuration (this file)
+    issue-tracker.md
+    triage-labels.md
+    domain.md
+```
