+# Issue Tracker: GitHub Issues
+
+This repo uses **GitHub Issues** as its issue tracker.
+
+## Configuration
+
+- **Provider**: GitHub
+- **Repository**: `xiaohai-uid/lingbi`
+- **CLI**: `gh` (GitHub CLI)
+- **External PRs as triage surface**: No (private repo, no external contributions)
+
+## Workflow
+
+Skills that read from or write to the issue tracker (`to-issues`, `triage`, `to-prd`, `qa`) use:
+
+```bash
+# Create an issue
+gh issue create --title "<title>" --body "<body>" --label "<labels>"
+
+# List open issues
+gh issue list --state open
+
+# Get issue details
+gh issue view <number>
+
+# Add label
+gh issue edit <number> --add-label "<label>"
+
+# Close
+gh issue close <number>
+```
+
+## Labels
+
+See `triage-labels.md` for the triage label vocabulary.
